{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/59eeed4b0590f38ace54ffee1dd25ab0.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=473 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726\u00a0<strong>Midgardr</strong> is a solo, turn-based city-builder and card game. You play on a <strong>board game</strong> <br>as a medieval administrator\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/861c2b1a7041c12b35f04b74678ca444.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/861c2b1a7041c12b35f04b74678ca444.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/861c2b1a7041c12b35f04b74678ca444.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/c5971624a1d53dcbd06ee5ef04672fcb.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/cabcab796126d4a728f7585af7b9697e.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=423 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/cabcab796126d4a728f7585af7b9697e.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726\u00a0<strong>Play cards</strong> and <strong>manage resources</strong> to build your settlement and keep your people happy and thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2726\u00a0<strong>Face moral choices and unpredictable events</strong> that threaten peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726\u00a0<strong>Choose your allies</strong> carefully and <strong>encounter mysterious figures</strong> offering <strong>quests</strong> that shape your destiny through branching paths and difficult decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/08c6a59b708c93e43be74b721b083186.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/08c6a59b708c93e43be74b721b083186.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/dc29703c357a98ed101c13dace310624.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Buildings and Resources\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>wood</strong>, <strong>stone</strong>, and <strong>coins</strong> to expand your village. Collect <strong>food</strong> to feed your villagers and keep them happy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9cc2b714c2bf3565a151461b4bb181e6.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9cc2b714c2bf3565a151461b4bb181e6.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely: build <i><strong>Residential Structures</strong></i>\u00a0\u2013 like houses and manors\u00a0\u2013 to grow your population; <i><strong>Productive Buildings</strong></i>\u00a0\u2013 like farms, markets, mines, lumberjacks\u00a0\u2013 to collect resources; <i><strong>Military Structures</strong></i>\u00a0\u2013 like towers and fortress to defend.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every urban choice has lasting consequences\u2026 and your people are watching. Will they remember you as a generous ruler, or a power-hungry tyrant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/148eb090304d07e7e76ced8ffad923f8.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Curtes and Politics\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2060</strong>The <strong><i>Curtes</i></strong> is the heart of your domain: your government. <br>It\u2019s your task to <strong>assign the right characters to each role</strong> within the <i>Curtes</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character bring his own <strong>trait and effect</strong>: use their powers wisely to serve your strategy and try to build a politically aligned faction with similar traits to unlock powerful bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t underestimate fate: some may fall ill, or even lose their minds\u2026 shattering your careful plans in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/f6789944587c05ae6c2c8c564f7e1104.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Events cards\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village will face <strong>strange and sudden events</strong>. A miraculous harvest: gift from the heavens or ancient curse? Knights in the woods: refugees or revenants? A strange egg: good omen or the spark of calamity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/a044a838104a90fbb0b59ff90238afc3.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/a044a838104a90fbb0b59ff90238afc3.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Each event demands a decision</strong>, but <strong>you won\u2019t know the outcome until you choose</strong>. What seems like a blessing may hide a curse, and what feels like a threat might bring unexpected fortune. The consequences will affect your resources and may even change the state of your village. You cannot escape fate, but you can choose how to face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/04080e0c443af5e3185dbe802d17d9b0.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Quests and Encounters\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your reign, <strong>six mysterious figures</strong> will cross your path. Some will ask for favors, others will plant seeds of doubt, a few may try to guide\u2026 or manipulate you. It\u2019s up to you to decide whom to trust and whom to reject. But every choice comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/526944d47f037c0e5a6339b29f851781.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/526944d47f037c0e5a6339b29f851781.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the main storyline of the game, told through a series of letters. <strong>Your replies shape your path and determine your destiny\u2014leading you toward one of several possible endings</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726\u00a0<i>Will your village flourish under your rule...or be swallowed by chaos?\u00a0</i>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9e939bc2af8a45acd62bf8c90c41530e.avif?t=1773138318\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras_big/9e939bc2af8a45acd62bf8c90c41530e.webp?t=1773138318 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645410?t=1773138318","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/7f6222ef5ffda623c2502bcb829499888b7540a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773138318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/27002a5ab312f8c94c892cd442e0bc1a9397eb79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773138318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/27002a5ab312f8c94c892cd442e0bc1a9397eb79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773138318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/59eeed4b0590f38ace54ffee1dd25ab0.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=473 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726\u00a0<strong>Midgardr</strong> is a solo, turn-based city-builder and card game. You play on a <strong>board game</strong> <br>as a medieval administrator\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/861c2b1a7041c12b35f04b74678ca444.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/861c2b1a7041c12b35f04b74678ca444.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/861c2b1a7041c12b35f04b74678ca444.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/c5971624a1d53dcbd06ee5ef04672fcb.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/cabcab796126d4a728f7585af7b9697e.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=423 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/cabcab796126d4a728f7585af7b9697e.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726\u00a0<strong>Play cards</strong> and <strong>manage resources</strong> to build your settlement and keep your people happy and thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2726\u00a0<strong>Face moral choices and unpredictable events</strong> that threaten peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726\u00a0<strong>Choose your allies</strong> carefully and <strong>encounter mysterious figures</strong> offering <strong>quests</strong> that shape your destiny through branching paths and difficult decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/08c6a59b708c93e43be74b721b083186.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/08c6a59b708c93e43be74b721b083186.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/dc29703c357a98ed101c13dace310624.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Buildings and Resources\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>wood</strong>, <strong>stone</strong>, and <strong>coins</strong> to expand your village. Collect <strong>food</strong> to feed your villagers and keep them happy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9cc2b714c2bf3565a151461b4bb181e6.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9cc2b714c2bf3565a151461b4bb181e6.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely: build <i><strong>Residential Structures</strong></i>\u00a0\u2013 like houses and manors\u00a0\u2013 to grow your population; <i><strong>Productive Buildings</strong></i>\u00a0\u2013 like farms, markets, mines, lumberjacks\u00a0\u2013 to collect resources; <i><strong>Military Structures</strong></i>\u00a0\u2013 like towers and fortress to defend.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every urban choice has lasting consequences\u2026 and your people are watching. Will they remember you as a generous ruler, or a power-hungry tyrant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/148eb090304d07e7e76ced8ffad923f8.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Curtes and Politics\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2060</strong>The <strong><i>Curtes</i></strong> is the heart of your domain: your government. <br>It\u2019s your task to <strong>assign the right characters to each role</strong> within the <i>Curtes</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character bring his own <strong>trait and effect</strong>: use their powers wisely to serve your strategy and try to build a politically aligned faction with similar traits to unlock powerful bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t underestimate fate: some may fall ill, or even lose their minds\u2026 shattering your careful plans in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/f6789944587c05ae6c2c8c564f7e1104.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Events cards\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village will face <strong>strange and sudden events</strong>. A miraculous harvest: gift from the heavens or ancient curse? Knights in the woods: refugees or revenants? A strange egg: good omen or the spark of calamity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/a044a838104a90fbb0b59ff90238afc3.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/a044a838104a90fbb0b59ff90238afc3.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Each event demands a decision</strong>, but <strong>you won\u2019t know the outcome until you choose</strong>. What seems like a blessing may hide a curse, and what feels like a threat might bring unexpected fortune. The consequences will affect your resources and may even change the state of your village. You cannot escape fate, but you can choose how to face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/04080e0c443af5e3185dbe802d17d9b0.avif?t=1773138318\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Quests and Encounters\u00a0</strong>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your reign, <strong>six mysterious figures</strong> will cross your path. Some will ask for favors, others will plant seeds of doubt, a few may try to guide\u2026 or manipulate you. It\u2019s up to you to decide whom to trust and whom to reject. But every choice comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/526944d47f037c0e5a6339b29f851781.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/526944d47f037c0e5a6339b29f851781.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the main storyline of the game, told through a series of letters. <strong>Your replies shape your path and determine your destiny\u2014leading you toward one of several possible endings</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.poster.avif?t=1773138318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.webm?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.mp4?t=1773138318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726\u00a0<i>Will your village flourish under your rule...or be swallowed by chaos?\u00a0</i>\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9e939bc2af8a45acd62bf8c90c41530e.avif?t=1773138318\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras_big/9e939bc2af8a45acd62bf8c90c41530e.webp?t=1773138318 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Holy Radish"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/c0ee4f745e1e1a80c3690814eeb5a09438c46ac3/header.jpg?t=1773138318","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3645410/972598782/1939c1b0b79d3eb45fd6ffa9295fe35f9862fb9e/1773137640/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773138315","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr